flowchart TD
    R[Single-shot image-to-code<br/>fails at 70 to 85 percent fidelity] --> A[Cause 1<br/>Vision encoder destroys pixel-grid precision]
    R --> B[Cause 2<br/>No error-correction signal in generation loop]
    R --> C[Cause 3<br/>Aesthetic prior pulls output toward training distribution]

    A --> A1[Patch embedding<br/>14x14 or 16x16 pixels per token]
    A --> A2[Within-patch detail<br/>collapsed to single vector]
    A --> A3[1-pixel borders, 8-pixel grid,<br/>text-baseline alignment<br/>reconstructed by guessing]

    B --> B1[Generator never looks<br/>at its own rendered output]
    B --> B2[No diff signal<br/>between target and produced]
    B --> B3[No mechanism to detect<br/>or repair regression]

    C --> C1[Training corpus dominated by<br/>shadcn, Material, Bootstrap, Tailwind defaults]
    C --> C2[Off-brand colors and spacing<br/>vibe-corrected toward priors]
    C --> C3[Every tool's output looks<br/>like that tool's house style]
